{% comment %}
Email sign-up for new chapter announcements and big Anno Arcana news. Sign-ups go straight to the
Buttondown newsletter (buttondown.com/forscher22), which sends the
confirmation email and handles unsubscribes. It opens in a new tab so
readers keep their place in the comic.
{% endcomment %}
<section class="paperDiv subscribe" aria-labelledby="subscribe-heading">
  <h2 id="subscribe-heading">Get an email when a new chapter drops</h2>
  <p class="subscribe-blurb">No spam, just a heads-up when a new chapter starts or there's big news. Unsubscribe any time.</p>
  <form
    action="https://buttondown.com/api/emails/embed-subscribe/forscher22"
    method="post"
    target="_blank"
    class="subscribe-form"
  >
    <label for="bd-email">Email address</label>
    <div class="subscribe-row">
      <input type="email" name="email" id="bd-email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
      <button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
    </div>
  </form>
  <p class="subscribe-privacy">
    Your email is only used for chapter updates and big Anno Arcana news (new issue
    releases, conventions I might be at, etc.), and that is <strong>all</strong>.
    Sign-ups are handled by Buttondown
    (<a href="https://buttondown.com/legal/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">their privacy policy</a>).
  </p>
  <p class="subscribe-powered">
    <a href="https://buttondown.com/refer/forscher22" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Powered by Buttondown</a>
  </p>
</section>
